					"slug": "demonhide-cloak",
					"list": [
						{
							"type": "entry",
							"content": {
								"title": null,
								"text": "A tattered cloak, stitched from a motley patchwork of unfamiliar hides and leather. Shifting odors waft from it: damp earth, ozone, musk, sulfur, rust, rot.\n\nIt is not a glamorous garment. Anything but."
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "entry",
							"content": {
								"title": null,
								"text": "When you **_wear the Cloak_**, its armor applies against demons in all cases, even if their attacks are piercing or ignore armor."
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "entry",
							"content": {
								"title": null,
								"text": "When you **_draw up the hood of the Cloak_**, you see clearly in darkness."
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "entry",
							"content": {
								"title": null,
								"text": "When you **_wrap the Cloak tightly about your person_**, you pass unnoticed by all so long as you move calmly and carefully and keep out of direct, harsh light. In retrospect, those you pass may recall a strange smell."
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "entry",
							"content": {
								"title": null,
								"text": "When you **_flay the hide from a demon, tan it, and sew it onto the cloak_**, mark 1:"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "entry",
							"content": {
								"title": null,
								"text": "When you **_make the last mark_**, you unlock the mysteries of the Cloak and can use The Flesh Remembers (see reverse)."
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "entry",
							"slug": "marks",
